CompassMaps has two parts under two licences.

================================================================================
1. The map files (the .pmtiles files and catalog.json in this repository's Releases)
================================================================================

The map files contain data from OpenStreetMap.

    Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

OpenStreetMap data is available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

The map files are made from the Protomaps basemap builds (https://protomaps.com), which
are OpenStreetMap data under the ODbL, cut out per country with the pmtiles tool. They
are offered here under the same licence, the ODbL 1.0. If you use, share or adapt them,
keep the notice "© OpenStreetMap contributors" and follow the ODbL.

Country outlines used to cut the files come from Natural Earth (public domain,
https://www.naturalearthdata.com). They are not part of the map files.

